aa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":8,"created_at":"2025-10-22T11:59:09Z","updated_at":"2025-10-22T18:49:54Z","closed_at":"2025-10-22T18:49:49Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n-Reproducable in: v4.6.dev2.mono.official [7864ac801]\n-Not present in: v4.5.1.stable.mono.official [f62fdbde1]\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 25H2 - v4.6.dev2.mono.official [7864ac801] - AMD Radeon RX6600 v25.9.2\n\n### Issue description\n\nI have a simple scene that can be seen in the screenshot below:\n\n<img width=\"378\" height=\"346\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f1dd9956-b916-4092-93c3-8f59bd3d6cce\" />\n\nWhen the mouse is hovered-over the button, it scales-up through AnimationPlayer. Since my intention was to scale it from its center point, I moved its pivot through Pivot Offset property. I can confirm it's set correctly in the inspector (100x100 image, pivot_offset is set to 50, 50), but when I run the scene, it keeps scaling from the top-left corner. The weird thing is, when I move the pivot point through the Pivot Offset Ratio property (0.5, 0.5), it scales correctly. Pivot Offset works correctly in version 4.5.1.\n\nIn the documentation, pivot_offset_ratio is described as follows: \"Same as pivot_offset, but expressed as uniform vector, where Vector2(0, 0) is the top-left corner of this control, and Vector2(1, 1) is its bottom-right corner. Set this property to Vector2(0.5, 0.5) to pivot around this control's center.\n\nThe actual offset is the combined value of this property and pivot_offset.\"\n\nSince it's \"same as pivot_offset\", it should behave the same.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Set the pivot offset in such a way that it corresponds to the center point of the TextureButton image in a similar scene\n2. Scale the root node through the AnimationPlayer\n3. It should scale from the top-left corner instead of the center point\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nTest project (gdscript):\n[pivot-offset-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23053364/pivot-offset-bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111914/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111914/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}